1
00:00:09,050 --> 00:00:11,030
(Supported by NRTA's Online Audiovisual
Quality Creation & Distribution Project)

2
00:00:24,550 --> 00:00:29,530
♪Black hair twines around bone♪

3
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:35,360
♪Night dew cold♪

4
00:00:35,490 --> 00:00:39,750
♪Bronze mirror cracks
through three lifetimes♪

5
00:00:40,490 --> 00:00:44,040
♪Shines on the sleepless♪

6
00:00:44,140 --> 00:00:48,580
♪Yunmeng Marsh ebbs and flows♪

7
00:00:49,050 --> 00:00:52,730
♪Vows sink deep♪

8
00:00:52,840 --> 00:00:58,360
♪White-hair curse turns to snow♪

9
00:00:58,400 --> 00:01:03,170
♪Covering the realm♪

10
00:01:07,530 --> 00:01:11,020
=Reunion Across Time=

11
00:01:11,050 --> 00:01:14,080
=Episode 22=

12
00:01:16,200 --> 00:01:16,799
Mother?

13
00:01:19,159 --> 00:01:19,799
Mother!

14
00:01:21,120 --> 00:01:21,879
Li.

15
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:24,640
Mother,

16
00:01:25,560 --> 00:01:26,879
what on earth happened?

17
00:01:27,200 --> 00:01:28,480
The day you were born,

18
00:01:29,879 --> 00:01:31,840
I lost control and killed

19
00:01:32,560 --> 00:01:33,719
twenty people in the village.

20
00:01:35,719 --> 00:01:38,159
This inner demon
has tormented me for twenty years.

21
00:01:38,799 --> 00:01:40,799
I can no longer control it.

22
00:01:42,760 --> 00:01:43,560
Li,

23
00:01:45,040 --> 00:01:46,079
kill me.

24
00:01:47,519 --> 00:01:48,879
No. No!

25
00:01:50,480 --> 00:01:51,760
I don't want to harm anyone else.

26
00:01:52,120 --> 00:01:53,159
Kill me!

27
00:01:53,680 --> 00:01:54,400
No!

28
00:01:55,519 --> 00:01:56,319
Mother!

29
00:01:57,480 --> 00:01:58,200
No.

30
00:01:58,640 --> 00:02:00,359
No, Mother!

31
00:02:01,840 --> 00:02:04,400
The previous Grand Shaman told me

32
00:02:05,599 --> 00:02:07,159
that your very existence

33
00:02:07,599 --> 00:02:10,479
is the hope of everyone in Jinan City.

34
00:02:12,159 --> 00:02:13,520
But I don't want...

35
00:02:14,520 --> 00:02:17,240
I don't want my daughter

36
00:02:18,560 --> 00:02:22,080
to carry such a crushing burden
at such a young age.

37
00:02:23,120 --> 00:02:24,199
I'm willing...

38
00:02:24,759 --> 00:02:27,280
I'm willing to bear it all for you.

39
00:02:29,759 --> 00:02:30,879
Forgive me.

40
00:02:32,759 --> 00:02:34,960
Forgive me for always driving you away.

41
00:02:36,719 --> 00:02:37,960
Deep down,

42
00:02:38,039 --> 00:02:39,840
I could never bear to let you go.

43
00:02:41,150 --> 00:02:47,983
♪My heart, a lonely fortress, locks
its gates around love's vines for you♪

44
00:02:49,360 --> 00:02:50,560
My child,

45
00:02:51,960 --> 00:02:53,039
I'm sorry.

46
00:02:53,055 --> 00:02:56,635
♪It's heartbreak, obsession,
and madness♪

47
00:02:56,655 --> 00:02:58,488
♪Don't stand alone in the moonlit tower♪

48
00:02:58,520 --> 00:02:59,400
Mother!

49
00:02:59,446 --> 00:03:06,012
♪I fear seeing your smile
reflected in another's cup♪

50
00:03:06,159 --> 00:03:07,280
Mother!

51
00:03:15,840 --> 00:03:16,680
Mother!

52
00:03:20,719 --> 00:03:25,886
♪Rain on the eaves chimes like jade,
echoing your pendants' chime♪

53
00:03:25,919 --> 00:03:26,560
Mother!

54
00:03:27,039 --> 00:03:27,759
Grand Shaman!

55
00:03:28,759 --> 00:03:29,319
Mother!

56
00:03:30,240 --> 00:03:31,080
- Grand Shaman!
- Mother!

57
00:03:33,280 --> 00:03:34,319
Li.

58
00:03:34,879 --> 00:03:36,000
Yun Hua.

59
00:03:36,063 --> 00:03:42,979
♪Old verses lie half-written,
for fear my words will run dry♪

60
00:03:43,240 --> 00:03:45,080
This is what I can't let go of,

61
00:03:45,680 --> 00:03:47,479
and it's also my inner demon.

62
00:03:49,520 --> 00:03:51,080
I've been tormented

63
00:03:51,639 --> 00:03:53,719
by this inner demon for twenty years.

64
00:03:54,960 --> 00:03:56,319
I'm so tired.

65
00:03:57,680 --> 00:03:59,879
I wanted to protect Jinan City,

66
00:04:00,759 --> 00:04:03,159
but it's too late.

67
00:04:04,360 --> 00:04:06,719
You must leave quickly.

68
00:04:08,599 --> 00:04:09,639
And...

69
00:04:10,319 --> 00:04:12,159
and stay alive.

70
00:04:12,719 --> 00:04:13,319
Mother...

71
00:04:13,599 --> 00:04:14,479
Grand Shaman...

72
00:04:14,719 --> 00:04:15,479
Mother!

73
00:04:17,120 --> 00:04:17,879
I...

74
00:04:19,319 --> 00:04:21,560
can't stay with you anymore,

75
00:04:23,800 --> 00:04:24,800
Li.

76
00:04:30,480 --> 00:04:32,199
- Mother? Mother!
- Grand Shaman!

77
00:04:32,680 --> 00:04:33,600
Mother!

78
00:04:35,680 --> 00:04:36,720
Mother!

79
00:04:37,879 --> 00:04:38,519
Mother!

80
00:04:43,720 --> 00:04:45,040
Mother!

81
00:04:56,519 --> 00:04:58,040
She was the Grand Shaman
of the Shaman Clan

82
00:04:58,399 --> 00:04:59,600
and also my master.

83
00:05:00,720 --> 00:05:01,920
I didn't want anyone to know

84
00:05:02,079 --> 00:05:03,319
she was controlled by her inner demon.

85
00:05:05,720 --> 00:05:07,639
In the end, I still couldn't save her.

86
00:05:08,720 --> 00:05:09,560
Thank you

87
00:05:10,079 --> 00:05:11,240
for staying with my mother
all this time.

88
00:05:14,680 --> 00:05:16,800
I found this in the Grand Shaman's room.

89
00:05:17,439 --> 00:05:18,399
This bamboo slip

90
00:05:18,959 --> 00:05:20,240
bears traces of a shaman's aura.

91
00:05:21,639 --> 00:05:23,639
No wonder my mother's inner demon
was driven out of control.

92
00:05:24,160 --> 00:05:24,959
So

93
00:05:25,759 --> 00:05:27,319
Lanruo used shamanic arts on her, too.

94
00:05:29,199 --> 00:05:30,000
You should go.

95
00:05:30,759 --> 00:05:32,480
I'm staying to protect Jinan City.

96
00:05:33,319 --> 00:05:34,319
Even if it means death?

97
00:05:35,600 --> 00:05:36,800
So what if I die?

98
00:05:37,639 --> 00:05:39,079
As a member of the Shaman Clan,

99
00:05:39,639 --> 00:05:41,560
I must fulfill my duty to the clan.

100
00:05:43,000 --> 00:05:43,759
Chu Li,

101
00:05:44,360 --> 00:05:45,720
you've been expelled
from the Shaman Clan.

102
00:05:46,560 --> 00:05:47,720
You needn't stay.

103
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:50,279
Listen to the Grand Shaman

104
00:05:51,120 --> 00:05:51,879
and go.

105
00:05:53,000 --> 00:05:53,879
I won't leave.

106
00:05:55,560 --> 00:05:56,680
We have more power

107
00:05:57,040 --> 00:05:58,160
than ordinary people,

108
00:05:59,319 --> 00:06:01,240
so we bear a greater responsibility.

109
00:06:03,399 --> 00:06:04,079
Very well.

110
00:06:07,480 --> 00:06:08,600
When will he wake?

111
00:06:09,800 --> 00:06:10,680
Song Ziyuan

112
00:06:11,040 --> 00:06:12,800
was affected by
the Grand Shaman's obsession

113
00:06:13,800 --> 00:06:15,839
and fell prey to his own inner demon.

114
00:06:17,439 --> 00:06:19,079
What exactly is his obsession?

115
00:06:19,639 --> 00:06:21,399
If I can't find his obsession,

116
00:06:21,680 --> 00:06:22,560
I can't send you

117
00:06:22,560 --> 00:06:24,319
into his memories to wake him.

118
00:06:25,560 --> 00:06:26,639
His obsession?

119
00:06:32,120 --> 00:06:33,879
(Why are there two extra bamboo slips?)

120
00:06:36,279 --> 00:06:37,399
That must be it.

121
00:06:37,680 --> 00:06:38,680
Let me go get it.

122
00:06:39,639 --> 00:06:40,399
Chu Li.

123
00:06:43,720 --> 00:06:44,879
Stay safe.

124
00:06:51,163 --> 00:06:52,439
(2 Days Before the City Falls)

125
00:06:52,439 --> 00:06:53,160
(2 Days Before the City Falls)
Chu Li!

126
00:06:53,160 --> 00:06:55,996
(2 Days Before the City Falls)

127
00:06:57,800 --> 00:06:58,399
Chu Li,

128
00:06:58,639 --> 00:06:59,480
where did you go?

129
00:07:00,600 --> 00:07:01,160
Fusheng.

130
00:07:01,959 --> 00:07:02,759
Where's Shiqi?

131
00:07:03,120 --> 00:07:03,920
Where is everyone else?

132
00:07:04,480 --> 00:07:05,240
I don't know.

133
00:07:05,480 --> 00:07:06,800
You suddenly ran out just now,

134
00:07:07,120 --> 00:07:08,680
and Shiqi told me to wait in my room.

135
00:07:08,879 --> 00:07:10,560
When I came out, everyone was gone.

136
00:07:10,920 --> 00:07:12,079
Did something happen?

137
00:07:12,319 --> 00:07:13,439
I'm so scared, Chu Li.

138
00:07:14,879 --> 00:07:15,879
(Sister,)

139
00:07:16,319 --> 00:07:17,480
(you'll regret this.)

140
00:07:23,199 --> 00:07:23,800
Don't worry.

141
00:07:24,040 --> 00:07:25,160
I'm here. Don't be afraid.

142
00:07:25,560 --> 00:07:26,519
Let's talk inside.

143
00:07:26,680 --> 00:07:27,279
All right.

144
00:07:45,279 --> 00:07:46,079
Chu Li,

145
00:07:47,639 --> 00:07:49,399
you're so cruel.

146
00:07:51,199 --> 00:07:52,800
I stayed by your side all this time,

147
00:07:54,040 --> 00:07:55,319
and this is how

148
00:07:57,079 --> 00:07:58,199
you treat me?

149
00:07:59,759 --> 00:08:01,079
Why did you lie to me?

150
00:08:02,079 --> 00:08:03,560
What manner of demon are you?

151
00:08:04,279 --> 00:08:06,079
Whatever I was before,

152
00:08:07,439 --> 00:08:08,279
why don't we

153
00:08:09,360 --> 00:08:11,360
rule this world together?

154
00:08:12,720 --> 00:08:14,040
Rule this world together?

155
00:08:15,079 --> 00:08:16,079
What exactly do you want?

156
00:08:16,959 --> 00:08:18,439
Don't you understand, Chu Li?

157
00:08:19,519 --> 00:08:20,240
I am

158
00:08:21,680 --> 00:08:23,959
the Great Shaman of Qin State.

159
00:08:24,839 --> 00:08:26,720
I never knew
you summoned the Chu Phoenix Call

160
00:08:26,800 --> 00:08:28,439
again and again to reverse time,

161
00:08:28,879 --> 00:08:31,399
trapping us all in this time void.

162
00:08:31,879 --> 00:08:33,600
Fortunately, I discovered it
in my previous life.

163
00:08:34,159 --> 00:08:34,879
Otherwise,

164
00:08:35,279 --> 00:08:36,360
who knows

165
00:08:37,399 --> 00:08:38,960
how many more lifetimes

166
00:08:39,039 --> 00:08:40,480
I'd have been trapped in this time void?

167
00:08:42,559 --> 00:08:43,879
Lifetime after lifetime?

168
00:08:44,559 --> 00:08:45,960
I don't know what you're talking about.

169
00:08:46,519 --> 00:08:48,279
Then go ask Song Ziyuan.

170
00:08:49,240 --> 00:08:50,399
He should know.

171
00:08:51,639 --> 00:08:52,279
Right.

172
00:08:52,879 --> 00:08:53,799
You probably

173
00:08:55,159 --> 00:08:57,080
won't get to see him one last time.

174
00:09:05,840 --> 00:09:06,679
Chu Li,

175
00:09:07,639 --> 00:09:09,480
Song Ziyuan may be devoted,

176
00:09:10,279 --> 00:09:12,320
but he's a useless man
with no shamanic powers.

177
00:09:13,519 --> 00:09:14,879
The one best suited for you

178
00:09:15,879 --> 00:09:16,799
is me.

179
00:09:35,080 --> 00:09:37,200
You can't escape my grasp.

180
00:09:48,039 --> 00:09:49,000
Who are you?

181
00:09:49,840 --> 00:09:51,120
Yaohua is dead.

182
00:09:53,000 --> 00:09:54,200
What manner of demon are you

183
00:09:54,559 --> 00:09:56,559
to dare insult the Grand Shaman
of our Shaman Clan?

184
00:09:57,320 --> 00:09:58,399
Patience.

185
00:09:58,840 --> 00:10:01,720
I'll send you to
see your Grand Shaman right now.

186
00:10:29,000 --> 00:10:30,399
How fun.

187
00:10:47,120 --> 00:10:48,360
Well, you're here.

188
00:10:48,919 --> 00:10:50,360
You can actually come back to life?

189
00:10:52,240 --> 00:10:54,200
You can't kill me.

190
00:11:05,240 --> 00:11:06,639
Yun Hua, are you all right?

191
00:11:07,399 --> 00:11:08,159
Chu Li,

192
00:11:08,559 --> 00:11:10,960
I'll send you into
Song Ziyuan's memories to wake him.

193
00:11:11,480 --> 00:11:12,399
I'll guard you.

194
00:11:12,679 --> 00:11:13,279
No.

195
00:11:13,600 --> 00:11:14,639
There's no time.

196
00:11:15,360 --> 00:11:16,600
Right now, in all of Jinan City,

197
00:11:16,840 --> 00:11:18,120
only I can help you.

198
00:11:19,120 --> 00:11:21,080
Go into Song Ziyuan's memories
and wake him.

199
00:11:23,039 --> 00:11:24,559
Save the people of Jinan City.

200
00:11:26,320 --> 00:11:27,639
Here are 49 bamboo slips.

201
00:11:28,440 --> 00:11:29,440
The ninth life...

202
00:11:29,639 --> 00:11:30,720
These are actually Song Ziyuan's

203
00:11:30,799 --> 00:11:32,240
daily records from the ninth life.

204
00:11:36,639 --> 00:11:38,240
So you and Song Ziyuan

205
00:11:38,440 --> 00:11:40,080
have cycled through nine lives.

206
00:11:40,559 --> 00:11:42,279
I'll take you into his memories

207
00:11:42,799 --> 00:11:43,879
to see for yourself.

208
00:11:50,799 --> 00:11:51,559
Song Ziyuan.

209
00:11:52,000 --> 00:11:53,639
You've been expelled
from the Shaman Clan.

210
00:11:53,919 --> 00:11:56,200
Why should I help you return?

211
00:11:57,399 --> 00:11:58,159
I didn't...

212
00:11:58,240 --> 00:11:58,879
Diviner Song.

213
00:12:03,200 --> 00:12:04,799
(First Life)
Help me become Grand Shaman.

214
00:12:05,080 --> 00:12:05,600
I promise,

215
00:12:05,759 --> 00:12:07,080
I'll do anything you ask in return.

216
00:12:11,519 --> 00:12:12,240
Diviner Song!

217
00:12:12,720 --> 00:12:13,679
I beg you.

218
00:12:13,879 --> 00:12:14,679
Let go.

219
00:12:20,240 --> 00:12:21,720
You're a young lady. How can you...

220
00:12:21,960 --> 00:12:22,799
So what if I'm a lady?

221
00:12:23,120 --> 00:12:24,960
A lady can also stop at nothing
to get what she wants.

222
00:12:26,679 --> 00:12:27,639
Then let me see

223
00:12:27,799 --> 00:12:29,240
just how far you'll go.

224
00:12:35,679 --> 00:12:37,399
(These are Song Ziyuan's memories.)

225
00:12:38,519 --> 00:12:39,600
(Let me see)

226
00:12:39,879 --> 00:12:41,879
(what exactly we've been through
all these lives.)

227
00:12:58,336 --> 00:13:02,123
♪Moonlight spills over
gray tiles and walls♪

228
00:13:02,390 --> 00:13:06,270
♪Wind chimes sway, evoking old times♪

229
00:13:06,571 --> 00:13:08,417
♪You come treading through snow♪

230
00:13:08,465 --> 00:13:13,880
♪Twin butterfly shadows in my palm♪

231
00:13:14,150 --> 00:13:17,890
♪Red threads wind through a few lines
of the book of fate♪

232
00:13:18,303 --> 00:13:21,920
♪Yet one passionate look undoes it all♪

233
00:13:22,440 --> 00:13:23,399
Miss Chu Li,

234
00:13:23,600 --> 00:13:25,480
you keep disturbing my master.

235
00:13:25,759 --> 00:13:27,399
He's never once been annoyed by you.

236
00:13:27,879 --> 00:13:30,039
But this time, he's already asleep,
and you still won't stop.

237
00:13:30,679 --> 00:13:32,080
I really can't stand it anymore.

238
00:13:34,080 --> 00:13:35,960
No wonder no one ever stopped me.

239
00:13:36,159 --> 00:13:38,759
So Song Ziyuan was fine with it
all along.

240
00:13:38,759 --> 00:13:39,600
♪Like vines, love♪

241
00:13:39,600 --> 00:13:40,720
Thanks for the reminder.

242
00:13:40,720 --> 00:13:45,894
♪Brews the years
into moonlight in your eyes♪

243
00:13:46,118 --> 00:13:50,211
♪Through three lifetimes, hand in hand,
we walk into oblivion♪

244
00:13:50,526 --> 00:13:54,193
♪Gray-haired, fingers entwined,
we still gaze at each other♪

245
00:13:54,240 --> 00:13:55,440
What are you doing?

246
00:13:55,799 --> 00:13:56,919
You scared me.

247
00:13:57,480 --> 00:13:59,360
You sneak into my room at night

248
00:13:59,639 --> 00:14:00,879
and ask me what I'm doing?

249
00:14:01,879 --> 00:14:04,200
Well... didn't you allow it?

250
00:14:04,679 --> 00:14:05,440
Otherwise,

251
00:14:05,799 --> 00:14:07,320
Shiqi would have stopped me long ago,

252
00:14:07,600 --> 00:14:08,159
right?

253
00:14:08,279 --> 00:14:09,000
Nonsense.

254
00:14:09,440 --> 00:14:11,799
He just saw you posed no threat to me.

255
00:14:12,320 --> 00:14:13,559
Don't flatter yourself.

256
00:14:14,000 --> 00:14:15,960
Fine. Call it wishful thinking.

257
00:14:16,919 --> 00:14:18,279
Why come see me so late?

258
00:14:19,320 --> 00:14:21,240
I just learned a new trick.

259
00:14:21,720 --> 00:14:23,279
It's only fun to watch at night.

260
00:14:23,799 --> 00:14:24,480
Come with me.

261
00:14:24,940 --> 00:14:26,267
♪No mountain or sea can bar the way♪

262
00:14:26,279 --> 00:14:27,200
Come on.

263
00:14:27,225 --> 00:14:32,985
♪I'd burn through every lifetime
to be with you♪

264
00:14:33,040 --> 00:14:37,160
♪Countless blades and a river of stars
fall into your cool gaze♪

265
00:14:37,277 --> 00:14:40,964
♪An echo of our first meeting
at the edge of chaos♪

266
00:14:41,337 --> 00:14:42,849
♪Like vines, love♪

267
00:14:43,036 --> 00:14:48,783
♪Brews the years
into moonlight in your eyes♪

268
00:14:50,203 --> 00:14:56,953
♪Night rain falls in the courtyard,
shining on mortal partings♪

269
00:14:57,363 --> 00:15:04,033
♪Strangers meet again,
past lives gleam in endless hues♪

270
00:15:04,403 --> 00:15:07,723
♪A sharp arrow pierces memory♪

271
00:15:07,893 --> 00:15:11,093
♪Longing spreads like dye♪

272
00:15:11,423 --> 00:15:18,083
♪Beaded curtains
keep love and hate apart♪

273
00:15:18,503 --> 00:15:25,163
♪Through boundless grief,
love remains hard to sever♪

274
00:15:25,453 --> 00:15:31,813
♪A past bond, a parting dream;
when cold ends, purest joy remains♪

275
00:15:31,983 --> 00:15:35,413
♪That year,
pear blossoms, verse, and laughter♪

276
00:15:35,673 --> 00:15:38,893
♪One night, snow fell in wild flurries♪

277
00:15:38,933 --> 00:15:45,813
♪All perfection in this world
hides regret♪

278
00:15:46,163 --> 00:15:49,693
♪A drop of heart's blood seals love♪

279
00:15:49,853 --> 00:15:53,413
♪No more longing enters dreams♪

280
00:15:53,813 --> 00:16:00,253
♪When all turns to mist,
may you and I be safe forever♪

281
00:16:29,163 --> 00:16:35,833
♪Through boundless grief,
love remains hard to sever♪

282
00:16:36,083 --> 00:16:42,373
♪A past bond, a parting dream;
when cold ends, purest joy remains♪
